Date: Thu, 29 Mar 2018 09:08:39 +0000
Subject: Re: [simmer-devel] Arrival 'choosing' resource
Message-ID: <PtVq18IQRxc.jpqMXrCgBQAJ@simmer-devel.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <PtVq18IQRxc.DtU95FNyBQAJ@simmer-devel.groups.google.com>
References: <PtVq18IQRxc.DtU95FNyBQAJ@simmer-devel.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/simmer-devel/c/PtVq18IQRxc/m/jpqMXrCgBQAJ>
